WEBVTT

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:16.670
I'm so glad you're both okay.

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:18.000
Hey.

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:24.840
So, what happened?

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:29.750
She showed up out of nowhere...
and killed Mannen.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:33.210
She said her name was Dot.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:37.380
Mine called herself Hyphen.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:41.920
She told me... to never come back.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:45.960
So... how come you didn't tell us anything?

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:49.540
Don't you care now you've cleared it?

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.750
Because... Because of you, Mannen--

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:52.630
Rika.

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:54.340
What would have changed?

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:55.710
What if you shielded Mannen?!

00:00:55.710 --> 00:00:59.250
You would never have made it back,
Rika! You'd have been killed!

00:00:59.250 --> 00:00:59.860
What?!

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:02.340
We were just worried about you!

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:09.920
Why didn't you contact us? Tell us why.

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:12.920
No.

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:14.130
Huh?

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:22.790
I wish I'd never gotten mixed up in this mess.

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:27.880
Didn't you choose this?

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:29.290
Neiru.

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:33.040
It was chosen for me.

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:38.500
Why did you call out to me?

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:51.670
I'm gonna get them back
for Mannen, no matter what!

00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:57.460
Ai.

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:02.460
Let's leave together.

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:03.500
Okay.

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:13.420
You can't even crack your Egg like this, Ai.

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:15.960
They'll get you if you don't release Leon.

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:20.170
No.

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:25.750
I won't let Leon out.

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:27.040
If I do...

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:29.540
You imprinted on them as their mothers,

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.460
but we created them.

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:33.130
Hey, Acca...

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:34.130
<i>Veni</i> .

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:41.500
Leon?!

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:43.670
Don't hesitate now.

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:45.420
Crack the Egg.

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:48.090
That is your top priority.

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:02.000
Huh?

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:07.000
You're...

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.540
...me.

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:19.790
Wonder Egg Priority

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:43.790
Episode 12: 'An Unvanquished Warrior'

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:41.920
What's going on?

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:44.790
Tell me, Acca! Ura-Acca!

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:48.920
Are you familiar with the term "parallel world"?

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:51.130
Only in comic books.

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:53.540
They actually exist.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:58.210
When someone makes an
important choice, or when they don't,

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:02.460
another them is created in a different,
divergent space-time.

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:08.340
I hate to say it, but in a different
space-time, the Ai you see there...

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:11.000
You killed yourself, didn't you?

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.670
I'm sorry. I...

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:19.880
You don't have to apologize. I understand.

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:26.210
Because of our eyes, you were bullied
and always on your own.

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:29.750
I couldn't talk to Mom or anyone.

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:35.040
Even Koito?

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:37.290
Who?

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:38.750
I see.

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:45.590
I'm fighting to save my friend Koito.

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:47.000
Your friend?

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.540
Yeah.

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:52.250
I see. You made a friend.

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:55.090
Now, I have others, too.

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:57.250
Neiru, Rika, Momo.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:58.540
That many?

00:05:58.540 --> 00:05:59.840
Yeah.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:03.460
So, you're happy?

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.840
Super happy.

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:30.790
Those are Seeno Evils. They're after you.

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:32.590
But don't worry.

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:34.840
I'll protect you.

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:36.750
You will?

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.710
You see,

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.460
I've gotten stronger.

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.500
Strong enough to do this!

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:50.460
Wow.

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:53.210
That's amazing!

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:54.540
Let's run!

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:55.540
Okay.

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:49.000
Ai.

00:07:53.290 --> 00:07:54.880
Are you okay?

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:08.420
What's Koito like?

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.590
She's special.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:16.130
She talked to me, even though I was bullied.

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:17.460
Lucky.

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:19.670
She's your precious friend.

00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:21.460
My friend...

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:27.460
I don't know anything about Koito.

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:37.210
Mr. Sawaki?!

00:08:37.210 --> 00:08:41.340
That's right. I'm your mom's fiancé.

00:08:57.210 --> 00:08:58.500
I'm going.

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:00.130
Take care.

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:25.920
Ai,

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:28.000
would you help me?

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:31.750
All right.

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:38.880
Watch out!

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:44.500
Art is an explosion!

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:45.790
Follow me!

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:47.130
All right.

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:52.210
Compliance is such a pain these days!

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:56.540
How are we teachers supposed to blow off steam?!

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:58.290
Where are you aiming?

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:05.960
Ow, ow, ow.

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:11.880
This is what happens to students
who disobey their teachers.

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:13.040
Leon!

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:24.090
Thanks, Leon.

00:10:24.090 --> 00:10:27.210
You're not Mr. Sawaki!

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:31.670
I am Sawaki. I'm your first love.

00:10:31.670 --> 00:10:32.790
Leon.

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:37.090
Mr. Sawaki is...

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:38.590
...a lot nicer!

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:43.630
That's my public face.

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:48.790
People are easy to fool
when you're born handsome.

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:51.920
What a pest!

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:04.460
You're a monster that my doubts
and suspicions created.

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:07.540
The real Mr. Sawaki isn't like this.

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:09.590
Oh?

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:14.170
It sounds like my public face

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:17.460
has you completely fooled, too!

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:32.960
In that case, how about this?

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:05.750
Koito.

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:16.880
You changed your hairpin.

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:18.210
Yeah.

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.840
Doesn't it feel gross?

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.920
Huh?

00:12:24.920 --> 00:12:26.500
Your shoes.

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:31.130
Take them off.

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:35.040
Sure.

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:37.130
Let's go.

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:41.130
I understand that you want to trust me.

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:43.090
I'm glad.

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:46.790
As they say, love is blind.

00:12:46.790 --> 00:12:49.170
I knew how you felt.

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:53.000
You love me.

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:00.710
A pure, unsullied love.

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.590
Compared to adult love,

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:06.090
it's far more fragile, ephemeral, and beautiful.

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:09.460
Both you and Koito.

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:12.670
Adult love is dirty.

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:16.710
Yes, it's full of self-interest.
Doesn't it make you sick?

00:13:16.710 --> 00:13:19.670
But one day, you'll end up like that, too.

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:21.710
Sad, isn't it?

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:25.630
That's why you should die before you grow up.

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:28.460
Don't you agree?

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:30.960
A world free from care.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:33.210
A comfortable world.

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:35.130
Won't you be happy there?

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:52.130
I'll support you no matter what, Ai.

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:55.500
You only live once. Enjoy it.

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:58.290
That's the same thing Kotobuki said.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:14:00.090
Kotobuki?

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:02.380
Nothing.

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:04.000
Koito...

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:09.710
...you regret it, right?

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:12.340
What?

00:14:12.340 --> 00:14:15.250
You regret it, don't you, Ai?!

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:19.420
Ai?

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:20.960
Say it out loud!

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:23.250
Shout it!

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:26.590
I regret it.

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:30.290
I want to see Mom!

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:09.210
Now I'm really mad!

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:31.250
Have you forgotten what your mom did?

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:36.750
She got dazzled by a man and
tried to put her own desires first.

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:39.380
You're so shocked you don't want to admit it,

00:15:39.380 --> 00:15:41.960
but even your mom is a stranger.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:49.420
When I stopped going to school,
Mom never blamed me even once.

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:56.170
She was always worrying about me
where I couldn't see, so that I wouldn't know.

00:15:56.170 --> 00:15:59.750
She said that she'd support me no matter what.

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:02.460
I want to support her, too.

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:05.210
If I don't, I'd feel bad for Mom!

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:09.250
You're almost pitifully innocent, Ai.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.500
Ai?

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:18.130
You be happy, too, Mom.

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:22.090
You've got my full support.

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:25.630
Thank you.

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:29.500
Ai!

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:33.340
I'm done with the me that craved attention.

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:34.960
I'm going...

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:38.880
...to believe!

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:43.840
If I don't, I can't protect anyone!

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:45.790
Can't love anyone!

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:48.710
That's the same mouth you asked me out with!

00:16:48.710 --> 00:16:53.630
Shut up!

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:05.090
Yes!

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:10.880
Five!

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:12.380
Four!

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:13.880
Three!

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:15.380
Two!

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:17.000
One!

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:17.960
Zero!

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:24.420
Koito!

00:17:32.130 --> 00:17:35.090
Isn't that great, other me?

00:17:40.090 --> 00:17:42.290
You can see her again soon.

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:48.130
I thought I wanted to hear the truth from Koito.

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:49.540
Maybe I don't.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.250
You don't?

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:52.540
Yeah.

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:55.540
I think I feel grateful.

00:17:55.540 --> 00:17:57.750
Even if she was a fake friend?

00:17:57.750 --> 00:18:01.670
I was saved back then.

00:18:01.670 --> 00:18:03.880
I wasn't alone anymore.

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:06.540
I've decided.

00:18:06.540 --> 00:18:07.960
About what?

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:10.340
I'm going to become a warrior of Eros.

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:11.790
Huh?

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:14.880
I'll fight Thanatos, the temptation of death.

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:18.420
I don't know how to go to parallel worlds yet,

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:21.000
but someday, I'll bring you back.

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:24.590
I'm sure your mom is sad.

00:18:24.590 --> 00:18:27.670
And I want to get strong like you.

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:30.790
That's silly.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:33.130
I'm you, aren't I?

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:35.960
Yeah, I guess so.

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:39.790
I promise.

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:42.210
Okay. I'll be waiting.

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:44.920
Ah, ah.

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:47.090
Ah.

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:48.090
Ah, ah.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:49.540
<i>Redi</i> .

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:55.790
I'm Kirara Rodriguez Matured XVIII
Evening Star SS Plum.

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:58.340
Kirara... Long name.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.710
Huh?

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:15.380
What's going on?

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:17.040
Let me in, you bastards!

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:17.040
Ura-Acca.

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:19.170
I swear I'll bring my wallet next time!

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:20.130
Her mission is over.

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:23.210
I want to get even for Mannen!

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:26.340
With hatred, she'll be taken by Frill.

00:19:26.340 --> 00:19:28.920
We'll never know unless we try.

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:31.630
Don't you care what happens to her?

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:34.170
She knows the risk.

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:38.960
You don't actually care about Frill, do you?

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:41.420
What do you mean?

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:44.790
As long as you can save Himari.

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:47.380
Come on, Ura-Acca.

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:50.500
Isn't that how we've always been?

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:56.380
I won't kill you. I won't.

00:20:09.130 --> 00:20:11.000
So shiny.

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:23.170
The other me...?

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:26.590
She protected me.

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:31.710
Ai!

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:38.000
I want shiny things.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:39.670
"Shiny"...?

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:47.630
Even I...

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:59.170
Good luck, me.

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:03.710
Sorry.

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:13.040
Thank you.

00:22:46.420 --> 00:22:48.170
Thank you so much.
